          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Your vehicle will never be newer than it is today.</strong></p><p>The moment you leave the dealership, your vehicle is exposed to contamination, swirl marks and environmental damage.</p><p>Protect it with 5-Year Gtechniq Ceramic Coating and we'll complete a full interior detail for free, leaving it flawless inside and out.</p><p>✓ 5-Year Gtechniq Crystal Serum Ceramic Coating</p><p>✓ Enhanced gloss, Scratch Resistance &  Easier Maintenance</p><p>✓ Complete Interior Detail Included Free</p><h1><strong>TOTAL VALUE: £1000<br/>TODAY: £500</strong></h1>",
