    "collapsible_content_BpPbAc": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_GzNAPn": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "DETAILING - FROM £299",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>The Showroom Reset. </strong>This service returns your vehicle to its original factory condition. It is a comprehensive top-to-bottom cleanse that includes a deep interior and exterior detail, engine bay detail, premium dressings for trims, plastics and tyres.</p><p><strong>Breakdown: </strong>Exterior Detail + Interior Detail + Engine Bay Detail + Premium Dressings</p><p><strong>Note: </strong>This is a cleansing service - consider adding ceramic protection or machine polishing.</p><p><strong>Custom & Partial Service: </strong>If you are looking for a specific, isolated treatment - like individual stain removal or an interior only detail - get in touch with us today for a custom quote.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_nxJ8MG": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "PAINT ENHANCEMENT - FROM £299",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Instant Gloss Recovery. </strong>Designed for vehicles with light swirl marks or dull paint. This single-stage machine polish removes the \"dull\" layer of the clear coat, restoring optical clarity and brings the paint back to life. It’s the perfect entry-level service for those seeking a dramatic improvement in gloss without the full correction timeframe.</p><p><strong>Breakdown: </strong>Exterior Detail + Decontamination + Single Stage Machine Polishing</p><p><strong>Note: </strong>Add an interior detail for an extra £100</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_RFLMPa": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "PAINT CORRECTION - FROM £1699",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Ultimate Paint Restoration.</strong> This is our highest level of paint correction, designed for vehicles with heavy swirl marks, scratches, oxidation, holograms, and significant paint defects. Using a meticulous three-stage machine polishing process, we restore depth, clarity, and gloss, achieving a <strong>90%+ correction factor.</strong></p><p><strong>Breakdown:</strong> Exterior Detail + Decontamination + Three-Stage Machine Polishing</p><p><strong>Note:</strong> Paint correction removes defects within the clear coat, but some deeper scratches and stone chips may remain if they have penetrated beyond the safe polishing limit.</p><p><strong>Ideal For:</strong> Enthusiasts, collectors, and owners who want their vehicle returned to the best possible condition.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_VAEVCQ": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "CERAMIC PROTECTION - FROM £799",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>The Shield. </strong>Ceramic coating creates a molecular bond with the paint, adds gloss, reduces new swirl marks, repels dirt, contaminants and water.</p><p><strong>Breakdown: </strong>Exterior Detail + Decontamination + Premium Exterior Ceramic Coating</p><p><em><strong>Note: </strong></em><em>Investment may vary if you require interior ceramic protection as well as if you have larger vehicles such as SUVs.</em></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_HaNeAq": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "DETAILING + CERAMIC - FROM £999",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>The Essential Duo. </strong>Your car is reset back to showroom condition and immediately protected with premium ceramic coating. This is the recommended baseline for vehicles that don't require paint correction.</p><p><strong>Breakdown: </strong>Exterior Detail + Interior Detail + Engine Bay Detail + Decontamination + Premium Dressings + Premium Exterior Ceramic Coating</p><p><strong>Note: </strong>If your vehicle needs it - consider adding a \"Single Stage Machine Polishing\" and/or \"Interior Ceramic Protection\".</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_V4tEfW": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "DETAILING + CORRECTION - FROM £1699",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>The FX Total Reset.</strong> Over a full  week, we meticulously reset every part of your vehicle and correct the paintwork.</p><p><strong>Correction Factor: 95%+</strong></p><p><strong>Breakdown: </strong>Exterior Detail + Interior Detail + Engine Bay Detail + Decontamination + 3 Stage Machine Polish + Premium Dressings</p><p><strong>The Result:</strong> Your vehicle is completely corrected and \"fully reset\"<strong> </strong>to the best condition possible.</p><p><strong>Note: \"The FX Total Reset\"</strong> focuses exclusively on the vehicle's bodywork, glass, and interior. For undercarriage detailing please contact us.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.fxdetailing.co.uk/blogs/luxury-car-detailing-projects/the-fx-masterclass-total-vehicle-reset-and-protection\" title=\"https://www.fxdetailing.co.uk/blogs/luxury-car-detailing-projects/the-fx-masterclass-total-vehicle-reset-and-protection\">Click here to see a full breakdown of <strong>The FX Total Reset.</strong></a></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_qQLYE8": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "DETAILING + CORRECTION + CERAMIC  - FROM £1999",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>The FX Total Reset & Protection.</strong> Over a full week, we meticulously reset and correct your vehicle to its peak condition and then seal it with premium ceramic protection.</p><p><strong>Correction Factor: 95%+</strong></p><p><strong>Breakdown:</strong> Exterior Detail + Interior Detail + Engine Bay Detail + Decontamination + 3-Stage Machine Polish + Premium Dressings + Premium Ceramic Coating.</p><p><strong>The Result:</strong> Your vehicle is not only \"fully reset\" to its best possible condition but is now better armoured against new swirl marks, dirt, contaminants and water.</p><p><strong>Direct Comparison: </strong>The £1,695 package is the same flagship service with an added layer of premium ceramic protection to the exterior of the car.</p><p><strong>Note:</strong> <strong>\"The FX Total Reset & Protection\" </strong>focuses exclusively on the vehicle's bodywork, glass, interior and protection. For undercarriage detailing please contact us.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.fxdetailing.co.uk/blogs/luxury-car-detailing-projects/the-fx-masterclass-total-vehicle-reset-and-protection\" title=\"https://www.fxdetailing.co.uk/blogs/luxury-car-detailing-projects/the-fx-masterclass-total-vehicle-reset-and-protection\">Click here to see a full breakdown of <strong>The FX Total Reset & Protection.</strong></a></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_8pLfa4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "VEHICLE PRE-SALE DETAIL - FROM £499",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Maximise Your Asset’s Value.</strong> Drawing on our decade of experience selling hundreds of luxury vehicles through Fratelli X, we provide a complete vehicle pre-sale rejuvenation service designed to secure the highest possible sale price. </p><p><strong>Breakdown: </strong>Exterior Detail + Interior Detail + Engine Bay Detail + Decontamination + Premium Dressings</p><ul><li><strong>Enhancement Add-on:</strong> Add a Single-Stage Machine Polish to remove fine swirl marks and dull looking paint - by doing that you rejuvenate optical clarity and deep colour saturation -  <strong>£300</strong></li></ul><p></p><ul><li><strong>Media Add-on:</strong> Professional studio photography and video service - <strong>£250</strong></li></ul><p></p><ul><li><strong>Commission-Based Sale:</strong> If we sell the vehicle on your behalf via Fratelli X, the detailing, media services and more are included <strong>completely free</strong>. <a href=\"https://fratelli-x.com/sale-or-return\" target=\"_blank\">Submit an enquiry here.</a></li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_pkjQW3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "NEW CAR DETAIL - FROM £999",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Correcting Imperfections & Adding Protection.</strong> Mass-manufacturing means cars leave the factory with light swirl marks, sanding haze, and transit defects. We address these immediately with a Single-Stage Machine Polish to refine the clear coat and ensure the paint \"pops\" with more depth than the day it was delivered and then applying a 360° Ceramic Shield.</p><p><strong>Breakdown: </strong>Exterior Detail + Interior Detail + Engine Bay Detail + Decontamination + Single Stage Machine Polish + Premium Dressings + Ceramic Coating</p><p><strong>Note: Total Ceramic Protection</strong> - We apply premium ceramic coatings to both the exterior and interior of the vehicle that adds gloss, reduces new swirl marks, repels dirt, contaminants and water.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_e9dTeB": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "MAINTENANCE DETAILING - FROM £100",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Preserve the Perfection. </strong>A specialised service designed exclusively for vehicles we have already detailed. This ensures your car maintains its showroom condition all-year-round.</p><p><strong>Breakdown: </strong>Exterior Detail + Interior Detail</p><p>Available at our Charlwood studio or via our secure mobile service covering Oxshott, Cobham, Dorking, Reigate and surrounding areas.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Meqw3y": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "SPECIALIST SERVICES & ADD-ONS",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Bespoke Finishing Touches.</strong> Beyond our primary packages, we offer specialised treatments to address specific areas of concern. These services can be booked individually or added to any detailing package for a total vehicle transformation.</p><ul><li><strong>New Car Detail From £999</strong> - A comprehensive new vehicle preparation service including a single-stage machine polish to refine factory paintwork, followed by premium ceramic protection for long-term gloss, clarity, and durability.</li></ul><p></p><ul><li><strong>Vehicle Pre-Sale Detail From £499</strong> - A complete presentation package designed to maximise resale value with a full interior and exterior detail, engine bay cleaning, decontamination, and premium dressings. Optional enhancement polishing available for improved gloss and presentation.</li></ul><p></p><ul><li><strong>Interior Ceramic Protection  £300 </strong>- Protects surfaces by repelling spills, resisting stains, and reducing wear and tear, typically maintaining an OEM matte look without being greasy.</li></ul><p></p><ul><li><strong>Headlight Restoration £80</strong> - We remove oxidation, yellowing, and light pitting from UV-damaged lenses. This multi-stage wet-sanding and polishing process restores crystal-clear optical clarity and improves nighttime visibility.</li></ul><p></p><ul><li><strong>Engine Bay Detailing From £80</strong> - A deep-clean of the heart of your vehicle. We safely remove grease and grime before applying heat-resistant, non-sticky dressings to all plastics and hoses for a factory-fresh appearance.</li></ul><p></p><ul><li><strong>Full Paint Decontamination from £200</strong> – A three-stage chemical and mechanical process (Iron/Tar/Clay Bar) to remove embedded road grime and fallout.<br/><em><strong>Note:</strong></em><em> </em>Once decontaminated, we recommend a single-stage machine polish and ceramic coating to lock in the finish.</li></ul><p></p><ul><li><strong>Paintless Dent Removal / PDR From £80</strong> - We eliminate small dings and \"trolley dents\" without the need for fillers or paint. This specialist technique preserves your original factory paintwork and structural integrity.</li></ul><p></p><ul><li><strong>Convertible Roof Restoration & Protection £400 -</strong> Fabric roofs are magnets for moss, algae, and industrial fallout. Our process begins with a multi-stage deep clean to lift ingrained contaminants from the fibres. To restore a factory-fresh appearance, we repaint<strong> </strong>the fabric to bring back deep, uniform colour to faded tops. Finally, we apply a dedicated <strong>Ceramic Fabric Protection </strong>to create an impenetrable hydrophobic barrier that repels water, reduces UV degradation, and prevents. future moss/algae growth.</li></ul><p></p><ul><li><strong>Sell Your Vehicle via Fratelli X</strong> - Leverage our decade of luxury automotive sales experience. We can manage the entire sale of your vehicle on a commission basis, including all detailing, professional media and advertising at no upfront cost to you. <a href=\"https://fratelli-x.com/sale-or-return\" target=\"_blank\">Submit your sales enquiry here.</a></li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
